  unitName: Bayonet Poetess Emily (EU)
  unitId: 730267
  unitNumber: 7221
  description: "If Emily had not joined the hunters, her destiny would have been
    quite different. She would have remained focused on her works until the day when
    the conflict would have affected her directly. Seeing that the miscreants wanted
    to damage her precious library, she took up arms and displayed her exceptional
    talent in combat. She then decided to go to war against those who initiated the
    assault: the Shapeshifters. She won many victories against them. However, noticing
    the lack of impact, she eventually got bored. She then decided to become a writer
    and succeeded in publishing several collections of poems, without much success.
    She then had regular correspondence with an admirer named \"L.\" Emily\u2019s
    interest was piqued after L claimed to be her sister. But was this really true?
    Quite a big surprise awaited Emily considering L is\u2026 a Shapeshifter!"
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: "Yes, give me some inspiration for my next poem\u2026"
  evoDesc: Fight? I shall do so if needed, but I quickly get bored...
